ity.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Resistant to all Radiant\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Radiant_Resistance_Full.png/28px-Radiant_Resistance_Full.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Radiant_Resistance_Full.png/42px-Radiant_Resistance_Full.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Radiant_Resistance_Full.png/56px-Radiant_Resistance_Full.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Resistant to all Radiant\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Radiant_Resistance_Full.png/28px-Radiant_Resistance_Full.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/4/4f/Radiant_Resistance_Full.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li></ul></div>\n</div></section></section>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section></aside>\n<b>Brine Bulb</b> is a light source on the <a href=\"/wiki/Nautiloid\" title=\"Nautiloid\">Nautiloid</a> and scattered across the <a href=\"/wiki/Nautiloid_Wreck\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nautiloid Wreck\">Nautiloid Wreck</a>. When destroyed, it creates a <a href=\"/wiki/Surface\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Surface\">surface</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Caustic_Brine\" title=\"Caustic Brine\">Caustic Brine</a>. Some bulbs fall to the ground when struck.\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Brain_Jar\" title=\"Brain Jar\">Brain Jar</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Caustic_Bulb\" title=\"Caustic Bulb\">Caustic Bulb</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715020001\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.092 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.095 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3602/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 33270/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 15263/4194304 bytes\nHighest expans